cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "waterqualityuganda" in publications use:'
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
title: 'waterqualityuganda: Drinking Water Quality from Boreholes to Household Storage
  in Uganda'
version: 0.0.0.9000
abstract: 'Monthly E. coli monitoring of drinking water along the chain from borehole
  sources to household storage in four Ugandan districts (Nakaseke, Kaabong, Kumi
  and Luuka) between November 2024 and September 2025. For each borehole, water was
  sampled at the source and, in three households using it, from the container used
  to carry water home and from the drinking water storage container. Samples were
  analysed by membrane filtration and classified into five contamination levels. The
  package provides four tidy datasets: field visits to boreholes, field visits to
  households, water samples with their laboratory results, and laboratory blanks.'
